Difficulty: medium. Complexity target: O(n) — each index is pushed and popped at most once time, O(n) for the stack and output space.

Probe test (pasted into the pad if they stall at hint level 3):
assert steps_to_higher([3, 3, 4]) == [2, 1, 0]
(Solutions that treat an equal reading as 'higher' — popping or stopping on >= instead of strictly > — return [1, 1, 0]; ties must not count, matching the strictly-larger resolution.)

